.TH LK 1 "October 2026" "LOOK 4.55.0 / Future Crash + LOOK 8.7.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lk \- inspect, navigate, manipulate, and ask your computer
.br
lo \- Ollama assistant with selectable local capability profiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lk
.RI [ command " | " thing ]
.br
.B lo
.RI [ --conservative | --workspace | --power | --unsafe ]
.RI [ @host ]
.RI [ prompt ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
LOOK is a terminal-native inspection/navigation layer with fuzzy filesystem workflows,
safe file actions, system inspection, Ollama chat, optional web search, and private remote Ollama routing.
.B lk help
is the authoritative live command/key glossary.
